<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 Page Not Found — <%= locals.appName %>
    </title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        :root {
            --bg: #06080e;
            --surface: #0c1018;
            --text-1: #dde6f0;
            --text-2: #8899aa;
            --accent: #ff4545;
            --accent-soft: rgba(255, 69, 69, 0.1);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text-1);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .code {
            font-size: 10rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.05em;
            line-height: 1;
            background: linear-gradient(130deg, var(--accent) 0%, #ff8c00 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-1);
        }

        p {
            color: var(--text-2);
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 400px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
            background: var(--accent);
            padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--accent-soft);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px var(--accent-soft);
            background: #e63535;
        }

        .footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 2rem;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #3d4f62;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="code">404</div>
        <h2>Oops! Page Not Found</h2>
        <p>Maaf, halaman yang Anda cari tidak dapat ditemukan atau telah dipindahkan ke dimensi lain.</p>
        <a href="/" class="btn">Kembali ke Home →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <%= locals.appName %> Framework &nbsp;·&nbsp; v<%= locals.appVersion %>
    </div>
</body>

</html>